      "seed": 364844953,
      "version": 3911,
      "versionNonce": 801352739,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786947197981,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Movie Booking System\n\nRequirements:\n1. Primary capabilities - success case/ failure case\n    - we can add movies to screens of theathres\n    - user search for movies, get list of shows on screens.\n    - user able to book seats for a show.\n    - booking function - lock seat wait 8 min for user payment else release lock on seat.\n2. Errors\n    - Timeout -- booking timeout\n    - lock -- acquiring lock on same seat\n    - invalid input -- user tries to book an already booked seat.\n3. Scope boundary\n    - NO UI, Actual Payment function\n4. Extensibility\n    - Payment strategies,\n    - seat types\n5. Tread safety\n6. Memory\n\n\nEntities, and relation, state model\n\nMovie\nScreen\nTheatre\nShow\nBooking\n    - status: started | confirmed | failed | Cancelled\nSeat types\n    - economy | premium\nPayment types\n\nList a Movie\nSelect a Movie\nList screens \nselect a screen\nselect seats\ncreate booking (lock seats)\nconfirm booking\n\n\nClass Design\n\nclass Show {\n        string id;\n        startTime: Date;\n        endTime: Date;\n        Screen Screen;\n        Theatre theatre;\n}\n\nClass Movie\n{\n    string name;\n    string id;\n    Show[] shows;\n    \n}\n\nclass Seat\n{\n    Type: Ecnonmy | premium\n    string id;\n}\n\nclass Screen\n{\n    string id;\n    Seat[] seats;\n}\n\nClass Theatre\n{\n    string id;\n    Screen[] screen;\n}\n\nclass MovieService\n{\n    Movies[] movies;\n    Theatre[] theatre;\n    Screen[] screens;\n    \n    Movie[] ListMovies();\n    TimeAndScreen[] searchByMovie(Movie movie);\n}\n\nclass Booking\n{\n    string id;\n    Seat[] seats;\n    string movieName;\n    startTime Date;\n    endTime Date;\n    status: STARTED | CONFIRMED| FAILED | CANCELLED \n}\n\nclass Payment\n{\n    pay(Booking);\n}\n\nclass UPIPayment:  Payment\n{\n    pay(Booking);\n}\n\nclass BookingService\n{\n    Payment payment;\n    BookingLock bookingLock\n\n    BookingService(Payment paymentStrategy, BookingLock bookingLock)\n        \n    Booking createBooking(Seat[] seats, userId){ // save booking to database }\n    confirmBooking(Booking booking)\n    {\n        payment.pay(booking);\n     }\n}\n\nClass BookingLock\n{\n    tryLock(string id, ttl); // id - seatId + showId\n}\n\nClass MemoryLock : BookingLock\n{\n    string[] id;\n    tryLock(string id, ttl);\n    sweep() // clear locks expired every 1 minute\n}\n\n\nlet movieService = new MovieService();\nmovieService.add(\n    \"The Mummy\",\n    new Screen(1), \n    new Theatre(1),\n    \"start-time\",\n     \"end-time\"\n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Movie Booking System\n\nRequirements:\n1. Primary capabilities - success case/ failure case\n    - we can add movies to screens of theathres\n    - user search for movies, get list of shows on screens.\n    - user able to book seats for a show.\n    - booking function - lock seat wait 8 min for user payment else release lock on seat.\n2. Errors\n    - Timeout -- booking timeout\n    - lock -- acquiring lock on same seat\n    - invalid input -- user tries to book an already booked seat.\n3. Scope boundary\n    - NO UI, Actual Payment function\n4. Extensibility\n    - Payment strategies,\n    - seat types\n5. Tread safety\n6. Memory\n\n\nEntities, and relation, state model\n\nMovie\nScreen\nTheatre\nShow\nBooking\n    - status: started | confirmed | failed | Cancelled\nSeat types\n    - economy | premium\nPayment types\n\nList a Movie\nSelect a Movie\nList screens \nselect a screen\nselect seats\ncreate booking (lock seats)\nconfirm booking\n\n\nClass Design\n\nclass Show {\n        string id;\n        startTime: Date;\n        endTime: Date;\n        Screen Screen;\n        Theatre theatre;\n}\n\nClass Movie\n{\n    string name;\n    string id;\n    Show[] shows;\n    \n}\n\nclass Seat\n{\n    Type: Ecnonmy | premium\n    string id;\n}\n\nclass Screen\n{\n    string id;\n    Seat[] seats;\n}\n\nClass Theatre\n{\n    string id;\n    Screen[] screen;\n}\n\nclass MovieService\n{\n    Movies[] movies;\n    Theatre[] theatre;\n    Screen[] screens;\n    \n    Movie[] ListMovies();\n    TimeAndScreen[] searchByMovie(Movie movie);\n}\n\nclass Booking\n{\n    string id;\n    Seat[] seats;\n    string movieName;\n    startTime Date;\n    endTime Date;\n    status: STARTED | CONFIRMED| FAILED | CANCELLED \n}\n\nclass Payment\n{\n    pay(Booking);\n}\n\nclass UPIPayment:  Payment\n{\n    pay(Booking);\n}\n\nclass BookingService\n{\n    Payment payment;\n    BookingLock bookingLock\n\n    BookingService(Payment paymentStrategy, BookingLock bookingLock)\n        \n    Booking createBooking(Seat[] seats, userId){ // save booking to database }\n    confirmBooking(Booking booking)\n    {\n        payment.pay(booking);\n     }\n}\n\nClass BookingLock\n{\n    tryLock(string id, ttl); // id - seatId + showId\n}\n\nClass MemoryLock : BookingLock\n{\n    string[] id;\n    tryLock(string id, ttl);\n    sweep() // clear locks expired every 1 minute\n}\n\n\nlet movieService = new MovieService();\nmovieService.add(\n    \"The Mummy\",\n    new Screen(1), \n    new Theatre(1),\n    \"start-time\",\n     \"end-time\"\n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
