      "updated": 1786952717217,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements:\n- Functional requirement\n    1. User/Client should be able to\n- Non functional requirement\n    1. CAP theorem\n    2. Scalability\n    3. Durability\n    4. Latency\n    5. Security\n    6. Fault tolerance\n\nCapacity Estimation\n- skip upfront\n\nCore Entities\n\nAPI \n\nDataFlow\n\nHigh Level Design\n\nDeep dives and estimations",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements:\n- Functional requirement\n    1. User/Client should be able to\n- Non functional requirement\n    1. CAP theorem\n    2. Scalability\n    3. Durability\n    4. Latency\n    5. Security\n    6. Fault tolerance\n\nCapacity Estimation\n- skip upfront\n\nCore Entities\n\nAPI \n\nDataFlow\n\nHigh Level Design\n\nDeep dives and estimations",
      "autoResize": true,
